# Base URL of the outage API.
#
# Empty  -> same-origin /api/* requests.
#           In development these are served by the local fixture API
#           (dev/fixture-api.ts) reading from fixtures/.
# Set    -> absolute origin of a hosted backend, e.g. https://api.example.com
#
# Production note: GitHub Pages serves over https, so an http:// value here is
# blocked by the browser as mixed content and every request will fail silently.
VITE_API_URL=
